## 5. Navigating between pages

| Action | React SPA | Next.js |
|---|---|---|
| **Render a link** | `<Link to="/learn">` (react-router-dom) | `<Link href="/learn">` (next/link) |
| **Programmatic nav** | `const nav = useNavigate(); nav("/learn")` | `const router = useRouter(); router.push("/learn")` |
| **Active link style** | `<NavLink className={({isActive}) => ...}>` | Manual: compare `usePathname()` to href |
| **Import from** | `react-router-dom` | `next/link`, `next/navigation` |

