## 9. CSS / Styling

| | `next-quest` | `next-quest-nextjs` |
|---|---|---|
| **Framework** | Tailwind CSS v3 | Tailwind CSS v4 |
| **Config file** | `tailwind.config.ts` | None — config lives in CSS |
| **Custom tokens** | `theme: { extend: { colors: {...} } }` in `.ts` | `@theme { --color-brand-300: ...; }` in CSS |
| **Import** | `@tailwind base/components/utilities` | `@import "tailwindcss"` |
| **Fonts** | Loaded via `<link>` in `index.html` | `next/font/google` (self-hosted, zero shift) |

Tailwind v4 moves all customization into the CSS file itself using CSS custom
properties. There is no `tailwind.config.ts` needed.

